# Never copy host-installed dependencies or build outputs into the image build
# context: `COPY . .` would otherwise overwrite the container's freshly
# installed, correctly-platformed node_modules with the host's (breaking the
# in-image build), and bloat the context. CI builds from a clean checkout, so
# this also makes local `docker build` match CI.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/generated
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.vite

# VCS and local tooling
.git
.github
.husky

# Fork-owned e2e project and its artifacts (not needed to build the images)
e2e

# Local env / secrets — must never enter an image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Editor / OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
